invalid type: string "Finding more information and committee\ndetails\nTo find out what NICE has said on related topics, including guidance in development, see\nthe NICE topic page on cardiovascular conditions.\nFor full details of the evidence and the guideline committee's discussions, see the\nevidence reviews and full guideline. You can also find information about how the guideline\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ